<title>JAPAN: Sakai Moving says raided by police.</title>
<headline>Sakai Moving says raided by police.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sakai Moving Service Co Ltd said on Tuesday that its offices had been raided by police on suspicion that it used an unauthorised subcontractor.</p>
<p>A company official said that the firm could not immediately confirm whether or not the allegations were true.</p>
<p>Osaka-based Sakai Moving's shares were listed on the Osaka Securities Exchange on October 30. The firm operates cargo and car transport businesses.</p>
</text>
